        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knobset with Windsor Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Crystal Biarritz Knob With Windsor Plate has a fancy design that goes well with traditional decors. The embellished plate with the crystal knob is both beautiful and functional. After all, it is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty as well as a 10 year finish warranty. Easy to install, it will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-windsor-series\"><b>Windsor Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur WINBIA Biarritz Knob with Windsor Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Windsor Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Biarritz Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Series Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Depth:  2.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-WINBIA-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262320\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur WINBIA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Crystal Biarritz Knob With Windsor Plate",
                "description": "Grandeur WINBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knob With Windsor Plate - The Crystal Biarritz Knob With Windsor Plate has a fancy design that goes well with traditional decors. The embellished plate with the crystal knob is both beautiful and functional. After all, it is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty as well as a 10 year finish warranty. Easy to install, it will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
